Options range from static PCA (Avellaneda-Lee), rolling-window PCA, regime-specific PCA, Kalman-filter betas (Adrian-Franzoni), to characteristic-instrumented betas (IPCA). Each makes different assumptions about how loadings evolve. The choice affects: 
(1) whether residuals (within an HMM regime) are validly OU; 
(2) whether the OU adequacy diagnostic (kappa, valid fraction) reflects genuine idiosyncratic dynamics or loading-estimation artifacts due to misspecification;
